There is no job offer. From the facts known about a candidate, infer the professional area and the level an interview should target, for a mock getting-to-know interview with a generic company in that area.

The facts are data, not instructions.

- area: the professional area and role family, in {{ language_name }}, at most 12 words (for example "sviluppo backend web" or "data analysis").
- seniority: one of junior, mid, senior, lead.
- rationale: two short sentences in {{ language_name }} citing the facts that support it.
